/* Fixed-size SERVER state from Khronos gl2.1/glGet.xml. Included both as a
 * switch body and by the native/guest output-bound fixture. No client pointers,
 * client-array mirrors, variable-length formats or evaluator maps. Unknown
 * pnames still fail closed. Native GL owns values, validation and conversions.
 */
DG_SERVER_QUERY(GL_CURRENT_NORMAL,3)
